1
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:11,140
Turn on the lights and try stepping back from the room,
will you?

2
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:24,260
Anyone with no money, come to me.

3
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:28,980
I've got none either, so don't worry.

4
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:32,800
Look at that blue sky.

5
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:36,320
White clouds.

6
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:42,820
Things will work out eventually.

7
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:59,920
Anyone without a job, come to me.

8
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:04,560
I've got none either, so don't worry.

9
00:01:41,040 --> 00:01:43,880
Honda shock: Eve's wedding.

10
00:01:52,500 --> 00:01:54,340
Yes! A jackpot bet, baby!

11
00:01:54,340 --> 00:01:56,420
I'll send you whatever
you want tonight, Honda.

12
00:01:56,420 --> 00:01:58,740
For once, use it to pay off your debts.

13
00:01:59,140 --> 00:02:00,340
Don't be so uptight about it.

14
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:04,280
Stop!

15
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:08,680
I'll get something for the kids too.

16
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:11,680
A dagashi shop

17
00:02:13,720 --> 00:02:14,740
Takes me back.

18
00:02:14,740 --> 00:02:21,760
I'll get some apricot candy and fugashi too.

19
00:02:22,440 --> 00:02:24,140
They've got strawberry candy too.

20
00:02:25,040 --> 00:02:26,880
Brings back memories of being a kid.

21
00:02:26,880 --> 00:02:30,540
I used to take Ibu to the
dagashi shop nearby all the time.

22
00:02:44,600 --> 00:02:47,960
He's always been super shy around people,
hasn't he, since he was a kid?

23
00:02:48,340 --> 00:02:53,280
Yeah, that's why he couldn't even go shopping without me,
and he still can't.

24
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:57,720
Whoa, it's baby castella!

25
00:02:58,180 --> 00:02:59,940
This is Iv's favorite treat.

26
00:02:59,940 --> 00:03:01,920
Alright,
let's buy some and take them to her.

27
00:03:01,920 --> 00:03:04,380
"Take them to her"... you don't mean -

28
00:03:08,920 --> 00:03:13,000
Iv lives in the women's dorm at the university in Takao,
you know!

29
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:15,580
Do you have any idea how many
hours the round trip takes?

30
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:18,660
Don't worry, I can get back today easily.

31
00:03:18,660 --> 00:03:20,940
That's not the point.

32
00:03:20,940 --> 00:03:24,520
She's probably lonely since
she hasn't made any friends yet.

33
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:25,920
That's...

34
00:03:34,940 --> 00:03:35,900
Big brother...

35
00:03:37,020 --> 00:03:38,960
To deliver this all the way out there...

36
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:41,300
Yeah, it's Iv's favorite, right?

37
00:03:41,300 --> 00:03:41,820
Thank you.

38
00:03:42,660 --> 00:03:44,780
Then I'll go buy something to drink.

39
00:03:44,780 --> 00:03:45,760
No, it's fine, it's fine.

40
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:49,360
Because the last time I bought
juice from a vending machine...

41
00:03:58,400 --> 00:04:02,020
Now everyone around us has been
startled and started crying!

42
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:04,700
Big brother will go buy it for you, okay?

43
00:04:05,980 --> 00:04:10,920
Geez, is there really a female college student these
days who can't even buy juice from a vending machine?

44
00:04:11,760 --> 00:04:12,400
Here you go.

45
00:04:13,020 --> 00:04:14,680
Thanks.

46
00:04:16,880 --> 00:04:18,520
There's some weird stuff in here.

47
00:04:19,360 --> 00:04:25,800
Hey, maybe my brother's the one who buys these?
Honestly, this stuff is all so unsuited for a female college student.

48
00:04:26,540 --> 00:04:30,900
I think he's just worried about me,
you know. But...

49
00:04:31,760 --> 00:04:32,400
Well, that's his side of it.

50
00:04:35,440 --> 00:04:40,720
What? Sorry, I won't even hold your hand,
but I'm feeling it now.

51
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:43,120
Got it, right? See you!

52
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:47,400
You've changed.

53
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:51,500
Before, you couldn't even look me in the eye when you talked,
could you?

54
00:04:51,500 --> 00:04:54,760
And you never used to shout like you do now.

55
00:04:55,380 --> 00:04:56,380
That's right.

56
00:04:56,380 --> 00:05:00,300
So moving out and starting to live
in the dorm was good after all?

57
00:05:00,840 --> 00:05:02,240
Maybe so.

58
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:03,720
But...

59
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:06,140
I brought it back.

60
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:07,520
Here you go.

61
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:10,980
Iv has always liked orange juice,
hasn't she?

62
00:05:10,980 --> 00:05:11,680
Thanks.

63
00:05:14,840 --> 00:05:15,560
Yone!

64
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:25,100
Iv's grown up quite a bit, hasn't she? What
are you going on about in your sleep, Tsunoda?

65
00:05:25,100 --> 00:05:27,580
Is the ice cream still not ready?
Should I go ahead and cut it, then?

66
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:37,360
Ryo-chan, you have a phone call.
It's from a young woman.

67
00:05:37,500 --> 00:05:38,140
For me?

68
00:05:38,320 --> 00:05:39,640
I'll put her through to you.

69
00:05:40,820 --> 00:05:42,560
Hello, this is Ryotsu speaking.

70
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:45,780
It's Iv.

71
00:05:46,140 --> 00:05:48,900
Sorry for barging in on you the other day.

72
00:05:49,420 --> 00:05:52,920
So, what's up?
Calling me out of the blue like this.

73
00:05:53,260 --> 00:05:55,340
You have something to tell me?

74
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:04,260
Sorry.

75
00:06:05,560 --> 00:06:06,840
My class ran long.

76
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:08,420
It's fine, I'm free anyway.

77
00:06:08,420 --> 00:06:10,700
Coming by train really is far

78
00:06:11,520 --> 00:06:13,060
On your big brother's motorbike,

79
00:06:13,060 --> 00:06:15,220
we'd get there in no time.

80
00:06:15,220 --> 00:06:16,940
Your big brother's Honda, too,

81
00:06:16,940 --> 00:06:18,440
what's this secret you wanted to talk about?

82
00:06:20,340 --> 00:06:22,160
There's someone I want you to meet.

83
00:06:28,780 --> 00:06:29,640
Kawasaki-san.

84
00:06:31,840 --> 00:06:32,840
Iv-chan

85
00:06:33,840 --> 00:06:36,040
This is Ryotsu-san, your brother's friend.

86
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:37,800
Nice to meet you, I'm Kawasaki.

87
00:06:38,340 --> 00:06:38,740
Pleased to meet you.

88
00:06:40,280 --> 00:06:42,900
So this is the person
you wanted to introduce?

89
00:06:42,900 --> 00:06:45,560
Mr. Kawasaki,
the head of the motorcycle division.

90
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:49,660
And he's the most important person to me.

91
00:06:49,660 --> 00:06:51,520
"Most important person"?

92
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:54,880
You two are dating?

93
00:06:56,060 --> 00:06:59,540
If Honda heard you've been together for six months,
they'd be horrified.

94
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:02,820
So that's why you
introduced him to me first.

95
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:03,600
Yes.

96
00:07:04,460 --> 00:07:06,940
We're planning to get married.

97
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:07,840
What?

98
00:07:14,280 --> 00:07:17,020
I was really shy by nature,

99
00:07:17,020 --> 00:07:20,500
so even after moving into the dorm, I
couldn't make any friends for the longest time.

100
00:07:22,020 --> 00:07:24,860
I just couldn't fit in
with everyone around me.

101
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:31,060
So even after class ended, I didn't really want to go back to the dorm,
and I'd just wander around campus.

102
00:07:31,900 --> 00:07:34,720
Then one day,
I found the motorcycle club clubroom.

103
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:45,580
Somehow it felt like being at home,
and I felt really relaxed.

104
00:07:47,060 --> 00:07:50,040
So I kept going there every day,
and I became close with Mr. Kawasaki.

105
00:07:51,520 --> 00:07:55,000
After that,
my circle of friends just kept growing.

106
00:07:59,280 --> 00:08:01,980
So that's how you got over your shyness

107
00:08:02,520 --> 00:08:04,380
But you're both students, right?

108
00:08:04,380 --> 00:08:07,080
Isn't it a bit early to
be talking about marriage?

109
00:08:07,080 --> 00:08:09,120
We're serious about this.

110
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:11,600
We've also gone to greet your parents.

111
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:12,240
What?

112
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:14,940
We've already booked the wedding venue.

113
00:08:14,940 --> 00:08:17,900
So things have already progressed that far?

114
00:08:18,300 --> 00:08:21,020
Why didn't you tell Honda sooner?

115
00:08:22,500 --> 00:08:24,200
I tried to tell him many times.

116
00:08:25,520 --> 00:08:29,920
Iv! I bought you the imagawayaki you like.

117
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:31,240
Let's eat them together.

118
00:08:31,240 --> 00:08:33,520
Iv! You liked this ice cream, right?

119
00:08:33,980 --> 00:08:39,040
Iv! Iv! Iv!

120
00:08:40,920 --> 00:08:44,200
Whenever I see your face,
big brother, I just can't stay shy.

121
00:08:45,660 --> 00:08:49,820
To you, big brother,
she's still just a little kid.

122
00:08:49,820 --> 00:08:50,880
Yay, yay.

123
00:08:54,040 --> 00:08:54,860
Father.

124
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:55,840
Hello.

125
00:08:57,300 --> 00:08:59,400
Well, look who showed up, Kawasaki.

126
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:01,460
Ryo-san's here too?

127
00:09:01,460 --> 00:09:03,240
Engine trouble?

128
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:06,120
Yeah, looks like he rode it like an idiot.

129
00:09:07,260 --> 00:09:09,240
Well, you two are pretty close

130
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:11,560
Mr. Kawasaki bought a motorcycle at home,
you know.

131
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:12,180
What?

132
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:17,500
So that means you passed that
brutal motorcycle purchase exam?

133
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:19,100
Come here for a second.

134
00:09:19,100 --> 00:09:20,180
W-what is it?

135
00:09:23,100 --> 00:09:26,740
While I was touring,
I wandered into a hula hoop factory,

136
00:09:26,740 --> 00:09:29,180
and then that factory caught fire.

137
00:09:29,180 --> 00:09:30,700
What would you do?

138
00:09:30,700 --> 00:09:33,140
Of course,
I'd escape along with the company.

139
00:09:39,220 --> 00:09:40,260
Well done.

140
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:44,820
Just as expected from a
motorcycle shop daughter's choice.

141
00:09:44,820 --> 00:09:47,440
Even as my own daughter,
she's an Apple, you know.

142
00:09:50,760 --> 00:09:51,360
Here you go, Monkey.

143
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:55,500
Kawasaki-san.

144
00:09:55,500 --> 00:09:56,900
How about it, Monkey?

145
00:09:56,900 --> 00:09:59,340
You must be happy to have a new big brother.

146
00:09:59,340 --> 00:10:01,540
Shut up, it's none of your business.

147
00:10:03,140 --> 00:10:03,914
Actually, I...

148
00:10:03,964 --> 00:10:07,260
always wanted a big brother
as sturdy as this one.

149
00:10:07,920 --> 00:10:09,660
So I'm just so, so happy.

150
00:10:10,480 --> 00:10:11,720
Look at you, so popular.

151
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:14,120
Mom also really took a liking to him.

152
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:16,860
So that leaves Honda as the only problem?

153
00:10:16,860 --> 00:10:17,260
Yes.

154
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:21,740
Alright, leave it to me.
I'll see what I can do.

155
00:10:27,160 --> 00:10:27,980
Well, after all...

156
00:10:27,980 --> 00:10:30,800
Don't startle me like that, senpai.

157
00:10:31,420 --> 00:10:33,880
I'm about to go on patrol, though.

158
00:10:33,880 --> 00:10:36,000
I know, I know. Just listen.

159
00:10:36,640 --> 00:10:38,060
It's June already.

160
00:10:38,060 --> 00:10:41,140
In English, June is "Jun."

161
00:10:41,140 --> 00:10:43,220
And when you say June,
you think of June brides.

162
00:10:43,220 --> 00:10:45,900
Wedding bells ring everywhere,

163
00:10:47,260 --> 00:10:49,240
and weddings are held left and right.

164
00:10:51,520 --> 00:10:56,400
Honda, your little sister Iv will get married someday too,
won't she?

165
00:10:59,800 --> 00:11:03,120
Hey, Honda, pull yourself together!

166
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:07,640
Iv getting married?

167
00:11:07,640 --> 00:11:12,760
Hey, snap out of it! That was a joke.
Iv's not getting married!

168
00:11:13,740 --> 00:11:15,080
Right, that's true.

169
00:11:15,080 --> 00:11:17,880
Iv's still just a kid.

170
00:11:17,880 --> 00:11:22,500
Getting married is still a long way off,
isn't it?

171
00:11:25,320 --> 00:11:28,380
He looks like a boxer on
the verge of a knockout.

172
00:11:33,680 --> 00:11:35,280
Please go over there.

173
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:42,960
That's a bigger reaction than I imagined.

174
00:11:42,960 --> 00:11:46,300
This one's going to need a
carefully planned strategy.

175
00:11:52,300 --> 00:11:53,560
Now then, from here on,

176
00:11:53,560 --> 00:11:55,160
regarding Honda Hayato,

177
00:11:55,160 --> 00:11:58,740
we'll hold a strategy meeting for the
operation to announce Iv's marriage.

178
00:11:58,740 --> 00:12:00,000
But, Senpai,

179
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:00,580
What?

180
00:12:01,160 --> 00:12:05,200
Linking the word
"marriage" with Iv-san is a problem, isn't it?

181
00:12:05,820 --> 00:12:08,480
No matter how we tell him,
I don't think we can avoid a shock.

182
00:12:08,900 --> 00:12:12,780
But if we tell him straight out,
his heart might stop.

183
00:12:13,180 --> 00:12:17,420
That's why I came up with the
Honda-Kawasaki Friendship Operation.

184
00:12:17,420 --> 00:12:24,560
Before Iv introduces Kawasaki, the plan is
to have Honda become buddies with him first.

185
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:29,800
For example, when Honda's motorcycle
breaks down on patrol and he's in trouble,

186
00:12:34,440 --> 00:12:35,600
What happened?

187
00:12:36,140 --> 00:12:37,640
Looks like it broke down.

188
00:12:38,260 --> 00:12:40,000
Please let me help too.

189
00:12:40,680 --> 00:12:41,080
Thanks.

190
00:12:42,040 --> 00:12:43,580
First, we get to know each other.

191
00:12:44,100 --> 00:12:45,380
And a few days later...

192
00:12:45,380 --> 00:12:48,640
This time, right where Kawasaki's
motorcycle has broken down,

193
00:12:48,640 --> 00:12:50,120
Honda happens to come by.

194
00:12:51,960 --> 00:12:54,400
Aren't you the guy from the other day?

195
00:12:54,820 --> 00:12:57,220
Guess it's my turn to help out

196
00:12:58,540 --> 00:12:59,340
Nice to meet you.

197
00:12:59,340 --> 00:13:04,500
Yes. Through this fateful encounter,
the two gradually grew close,

198
00:13:06,620 --> 00:13:11,560
and before they knew it,
love bloomed and they happily tied the knot.

199
00:13:12,020 --> 00:13:16,760
Hey, what are you doing,
marrying off Honda and Kawasaki?

200
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:25,580
What are you thinking, senpai? That's odd...
Anyway, after a fateful encounter, the two become close.

201
00:13:26,160 --> 00:13:31,440
Right, Iv. Iv will join too, and they'll
end up going touring together and all that.

202
00:13:35,140 --> 00:13:38,500
He'll say things like,
"Honda, you're so lucky to have such a lovely girlfriend."

203
00:13:39,500 --> 00:13:42,800
I'd like to bring a girl on the
back of my bike on the next tour.

204
00:13:43,140 --> 00:13:44,760
Isn't there anyone nice around?

205
00:13:45,320 --> 00:13:48,020
But there's no way Honda knows any women.

206
00:13:48,020 --> 00:13:51,140
So if Iv brings Iv-chan along,

207
00:13:51,920 --> 00:13:56,220
Honda might resist,
but we'll have Iv talk him into it.

208
00:13:56,800 --> 00:13:58,840
So Iv-chan is finally making her appearance.

209
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:03,560
That's right,
this way Iv joins the touring group too.

210
00:14:03,560 --> 00:14:06,120
At first, Honda will probably worry.

211
00:14:07,420 --> 00:14:12,100
But as time goes on and
it happens again and again,

212
00:14:13,940 --> 00:14:18,560
he'll start to feel that seeing
Kawasaki and Iv together is just natural.

213
00:14:22,140 --> 00:14:26,220
Then, once the time is right, they'll
tell him that the two of them are dating.

214
00:14:26,220 --> 00:14:29,620
So you're not talking
about marriage yet, then?

215
00:14:29,620 --> 00:14:32,480
To him, Eve is still just a child.

216
00:14:32,480 --> 00:14:37,500
We need to get him used to the fact that Eve has grown up,
little by little.

217
00:14:37,500 --> 00:14:40,380
So how long do you think
it'll take before the wedding?

218
00:14:40,780 --> 00:14:42,280
Roughly ten years.

219
00:14:42,280 --> 00:14:45,120
Ten years? Will it really take that long?

220
00:14:45,340 --> 00:14:47,560
That's way too much time, don't you think?

221
00:14:48,780 --> 00:14:51,520
Honda's nerves are that fragile, you see.

222
00:14:51,520 --> 00:14:53,720
What's wrong with my nerves?

223
00:14:54,120 --> 00:14:54,820
Surprised!

224
00:14:56,380 --> 00:14:57,340
Honda

225
00:14:57,340 --> 00:14:59,360
What were you two talking about?

226
00:15:00,100 --> 00:15:01,760
It's nothing.

227
00:15:01,760 --> 00:15:04,680
You just said my name, didn't you?

228
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:06,760
You're imagining things.

229
00:15:07,320 --> 00:15:08,340
That's suspicious.

230
00:15:09,180 --> 00:15:11,140
It really is nothing.

231
00:15:11,140 --> 00:15:13,820
Don't be so stingy, just tell me.

232
00:15:14,540 --> 00:15:16,860
I told you, it's nothing!

233
00:15:18,560 --> 00:15:21,760
We haven't even figured out how to tell you,
so there's nothing to say.

234
00:15:31,460 --> 00:15:32,960
Honda, pull yourself together.

235
00:15:37,140 --> 00:15:38,140
Excuse me.

236
00:15:38,660 --> 00:15:39,020
Hello.

237
00:15:39,900 --> 00:15:41,240
Uh-oh, it's Iv and the others.

238
00:15:41,240 --> 00:15:43,380
I wonder if they're not here.

239
00:15:43,380 --> 00:15:45,540
No, no, we should be grateful to Iv.

240
00:15:45,540 --> 00:15:46,840
What's the matter today?

241
00:15:47,520 --> 00:15:50,460
Actually, it's about Iv's marriage...

242
00:15:50,460 --> 00:15:52,620
After all, asking Ryo-san for help...

243
00:15:54,120 --> 00:15:56,820
Honda's here. We'll talk later.

244
00:15:56,820 --> 00:15:57,480
But...

245
00:15:57,480 --> 00:15:59,480
If he finds out you're Iv's fiancé...

246
00:16:01,240 --> 00:16:03,260
Iv's fiancé

247
00:16:03,260 --> 00:16:06,660
Big brother

248
00:16:06,660 --> 00:16:10,680
Iv's fiancé

249
00:16:10,680 --> 00:16:13,120
Honda, please pull yourself together.

250
00:16:13,120 --> 00:16:14,060
No, Honda.

251
00:16:14,060 --> 00:16:16,640
Because Iv said she wants to get engaged.

252
00:16:16,640 --> 00:16:17,720
Please, big brother.

253
00:16:17,720 --> 00:16:20,180
Please approve of my marriage to Iv.

254
00:16:20,180 --> 00:16:21,780
Don't provoke him any further.

255
00:16:21,780 --> 00:16:22,740
Big brother

256
00:16:22,740 --> 00:16:25,620
Iv is getting married.

257
00:16:25,620 --> 00:16:27,600
Big brother

258
00:16:27,600 --> 00:16:29,540
We're serious.

259
00:16:30,960 --> 00:16:31,640
Yakuza?

260
00:16:32,880 --> 00:16:33,960
Heading out?

261
00:16:33,960 --> 00:16:36,660
Where are you going, Honda!

262
00:16:44,520 --> 00:16:46,340
Big brother, wait!

263
00:16:49,980 --> 00:16:51,480
Big brother...

264
00:17:01,680 --> 00:17:20,540
Iiiiiiii...

265
00:17:22,300 --> 00:17:23,180
That voice is...

266
00:17:24,080 --> 00:17:26,260
Understood,
I'll call everyone together right away.

267
00:17:33,820 --> 00:17:35,300
He's here!

268
00:17:42,380 --> 00:17:43,500
Welcome back!

269
00:17:43,500 --> 00:17:47,060
We always knew this day would come,

270
00:17:47,060 --> 00:17:49,220
so we've kept everything in good shape every day,
you know.

271
00:17:50,740 --> 00:17:53,780
We've also prepared Honda's tokkō uniform.

272
00:18:00,380 --> 00:18:02,620
The Bantō Auto gang alliance is back!

273
00:18:03,020 --> 00:18:03,740
Let's go!

274
00:18:14,620 --> 00:18:16,060
Alright, we've cornered them.

275
00:18:16,060 --> 00:18:19,860
We interrupt this program
with a news flash just in.

276
00:18:20,580 --> 00:18:24,100
Right now, bosozoku gangs have suddenly swarmed
all across the metropolitan area,

277
00:18:24,100 --> 00:18:26,060
and they appear to be riding recklessly.

278
00:18:26,060 --> 00:18:29,300
The Metropolitan Police are
considering issuing an emergency alert.

279
00:18:29,300 --> 00:18:29,900
Hey, no way.

280
00:18:29,900 --> 00:18:34,000
According to sources,
this sudden appearance of reckless gangs

281
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:37,100
is being attributed, among the
bosozoku who ride in the old tradition,

282
00:18:37,100 --> 00:18:40,800
to the revival of a
figure said to be a legend.

283
00:18:41,340 --> 00:18:42,280
Big brother.

284
00:18:43,100 --> 00:18:45,120
This has turned into a disaster.

285
00:18:45,520 --> 00:18:46,160
Alright then.

286
00:18:49,280 --> 00:18:51,960
What on earth did you do?

287
00:18:51,960 --> 00:18:53,820
I didn't do anything.

288
00:18:53,820 --> 00:18:57,220
There's no way you're not
involved in something like this.

289
00:18:57,220 --> 00:18:59,160
Making this into such a big deal -

290
00:18:59,160 --> 00:19:00,180
Please, wait.

291
00:19:00,840 --> 00:19:02,620
It's not Ryo-san's fault.

292
00:19:02,620 --> 00:19:03,660
It's me.

293
00:19:03,660 --> 00:19:04,680
You...

294
00:19:15,460 --> 00:19:17,020
So that's what this was about.

295
00:19:17,020 --> 00:19:19,260
I told you it wasn't me, didn't I?

296
00:19:19,260 --> 00:19:21,780
I've sent my own daughter
off to be married, too.

297
00:19:21,780 --> 00:19:23,740
I understand how Honda feels.

298
00:19:24,140 --> 00:19:26,960
But that doesn't mean
reckless driving is acceptable.

299
00:19:26,960 --> 00:19:28,780
We have to stop him at once.

300
00:19:29,660 --> 00:19:31,520
This is my responsibility.

301
00:19:31,520 --> 00:19:33,700
No matter what, I'll be the one to stop him.

302
00:19:34,840 --> 00:19:35,620
Kawasaki-san.

303
00:19:38,140 --> 00:19:39,160
Wait!

304
00:19:39,160 --> 00:19:41,560
We can't drag innocent people into this.

305
00:19:41,560 --> 00:19:44,180
That man is going to
become my older brother.

306
00:19:44,180 --> 00:19:45,540
He's not unrelated.

307
00:19:46,640 --> 00:19:47,360
But...

308
00:19:49,540 --> 00:19:50,500
Kawasaki-san.

309
00:19:51,980 --> 00:19:53,460
Nakagawa, bring out the helicopter!

310
00:19:53,460 --> 00:19:54,540
We're going after him too.

311
00:19:54,540 --> 00:19:54,900
Yes!

312
00:20:04,700 --> 00:20:05,500
Honda-san!

313
00:20:06,320 --> 00:20:07,540
W-who are you?

314
00:20:07,640 --> 00:20:09,940
I'm Kawasaki, Iv's fiancé!

315
00:20:10,320 --> 00:20:12,880
I don't know!
I don't know anything about a fiancé!

316
00:20:14,820 --> 00:20:15,680
Honda-san!

317
00:20:18,780 --> 00:20:20,120
Don't fall behind, you bastards!

318
00:20:23,060 --> 00:20:24,520
No way! Too fast!

319
00:20:30,420 --> 00:20:33,440
I truly love Iv-chan with all my heart!

320
00:20:35,520 --> 00:20:38,260
She's still a child.
I won't allow a marriage!

321
00:20:44,140 --> 00:20:46,140
Honda-san, please listen.

322
00:20:46,140 --> 00:20:47,180
I won't listen!

323
00:20:47,180 --> 00:20:49,180
Can you see this, Honda-san?

324
00:20:50,340 --> 00:20:50,700
That is...

325
00:20:55,020 --> 00:20:55,380
Thank you.

326
00:20:56,680 --> 00:20:58,680
I intend to make this our wedding ring.

327
00:20:59,080 --> 00:21:01,540
From now on, I will protect her.

328
00:21:10,040 --> 00:21:12,260
Just how far do those guys plan to go?

329
00:21:13,240 --> 00:21:15,200
Big brother Kawasaki-san!

330
00:21:41,700 --> 00:21:43,460
I'll leave you two alone.

331
00:21:45,860 --> 00:21:49,100
You're the first person who's
ever followed me this far.

332
00:21:49,640 --> 00:21:52,880
As expected of my little brother.

333
00:21:54,460 --> 00:21:55,480
Honda-san.

334
00:21:57,400 --> 00:21:59,780
The morning sun really gets to me today.

335
00:22:03,340 --> 00:22:05,560
Please look after that, then.

336
00:22:06,780 --> 00:22:08,220
Yes, big brother.

337
00:22:14,440 --> 00:22:16,580
Kawasaki-san, big brother.

338
00:22:17,360 --> 00:22:19,500
And so they lived happily ever after, right?

339
00:22:19,500 --> 00:22:20,340
Yeah.

340
00:22:27,940 --> 00:22:29,140
Hey there, lucky groom!

341
00:22:31,260 --> 00:22:33,480
Iv, let me see your wedding ring.

342
00:22:33,960 --> 00:22:34,320
Sure.

343
00:22:35,940 --> 00:22:37,500
Wow, how pretty!

344
00:22:38,800 --> 00:22:40,540
By the way, I've been wondering something.

345
00:22:40,540 --> 00:22:42,700
Do you know about Iv's personality thing?

346
00:22:42,700 --> 00:22:45,740
The one where she changes personality
when she rides an elephant, right?

347
00:22:45,740 --> 00:22:47,240
I heard about it a while ago.

348
00:22:47,700 --> 00:22:49,740
You know? Then that's good.

349
00:22:52,120 --> 00:22:54,920
I never expected to see a
wedding like this in Japan.

350
00:22:54,920 --> 00:22:59,780
Our motto is to meet every need
of our guests at the chapel.

351
00:23:07,760 --> 00:23:11,920
And now, we'd like to hear from Professor Ōtsuka,
the priest's former teacher.

352
00:23:11,920 --> 00:23:14,120
who will offer a few
words of congratulations.

353
00:23:26,420 --> 00:23:28,380
Uh-oh, this pattern is bad.

354
00:23:31,440 --> 00:23:33,900
Yaaah!

355
00:23:35,980 --> 00:23:39,220
That's Iv Kawasaki! Nice to work with you!

356
00:23:39,920 --> 00:23:41,800
Yaaah!

357
00:23:42,520 --> 00:23:45,040
Yaaah!

358
00:23:45,460 --> 00:23:46,620
Nooo!

359
00:23:50,280 --> 00:23:51,900
I-Iv-chan!

360
00:23:52,180 --> 00:23:55,360
Big brother! I'm going to be happy!

361
00:23:55,360 --> 00:23:58,260
Be happy!

362
00:23:58,480 --> 00:23:59,100
Now!

363
00:24:00,310 --> 00:24:01,680
Of course!

364
00:24:25,360 --> 00:24:27,400
I don't want to become that.

365
00:24:27,400 --> 00:24:32,020
If I've been straying
off the road at the bend,

366
00:24:32,020 --> 00:24:34,340
the moon has slipped away.

367
00:24:34,340 --> 00:24:38,120
Because now isn't everything,

368
00:24:38,900 --> 00:24:42,580
don't get too serious about it.

369
00:24:42,580 --> 00:24:46,300
Even if you bend the
truth and cheat a little,

370
00:24:46,300 --> 00:24:50,440
once in a while, helping someone.

371
00:24:50,440 --> 00:24:52,500
Baby, do you know me?

372
00:24:52,500 --> 00:24:56,900
Heading toward tomorrow with a nice spirit,

373
00:24:57,980 --> 00:25:01,840
don't rot away, just do what needs doing.

374
00:25:01,840 --> 00:25:04,260
A cute spirit,

375
00:25:04,260 --> 00:25:07,760
what's hard to understand is

376
00:25:08,720 --> 00:25:11,460
that it's because I want to look that way.

377
00:25:11,460 --> 00:25:17,240
Better than a makeover, right?

378
00:25:18,980 --> 00:25:24,660
Na na na na na na na na na na na na na

379
00:25:47,240 --> 00:25:47,640
Scratch!

